# Absolute path to YOUR project's git repo (the one the agents work in).
# It is mounted read-only into the MCP container so the server can read docs
# and resolve historical blobs. Example:
#REPO_HOST_PATH=FILLME
#JIRA_BASE_URL=FILLME
#JIRA_USER_EMAIL=FILLME
#JIRA_API_TOKEN=FILLME
#CG_LANG=FILLME
#LSP_INIT_TIMEOUT=90
# Grafana (local laptop instance, reads the persistent Prometheus service).
# Defaults: admin / admin. Change before exposing the port beyond localhost.
#GRAFANA_ADMIN_USER=admin
#GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=FILLME
# Persistent laptop Prometheus: host port 9091 (localhost:9090 is reserved
# for the observe.sh SUT tunnel). Data is kept 365 days in the
# prometheus-storage volume; no env config needed unless you change ports.